<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">KOLOSE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Colossians</para>
  <para style="toc2">KOLOSE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt">KOLOSE HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Colossians</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Kolose hae kalan Paul Ccaky</char> hynh Asia Minor ram kyaze khuapi khua kheit athuapaw, Efesa khua kyate nithua lang a umpaw Kolose khriccaawbuu kalan a kypaw nynh thua. Asia ram, Rom Accozah nynh a ukpaw ram lungkhu e Efesa kyate ryalahtu a saw hae keiccuze hynh-e khriccaawbuu tuh Paul nynh a raepaw athua khyh zemah Paul nynh tuin ram kya rya ka hoi ci ciate a tuaku. Kolose khriccaawbuu kya ccangpahseitu hae um hae zah tuh-e hae nynh: ccungccaw lu kheit nynh Pachia nynaw elang te accingpaw khumnaw ccounaw elang hynh “uktu hae te muisaw uktu hae” a beik aho, a ci hae paw kha a thae. Tuhpiaze hynh-e ccangpahtu hae nynh zyntu lu kheit nynh tuh a rae lanpaw vingdungawkunaw, aenia kong te ccaccangpaw balyn a zui aho a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul nynh ahmepaw Khriccaaw phung te hynh-e ccangpyanaw hae tuh a rawsekuh hae cite a zei. A ccaw nynh abyapi lante a ho rypaw tuh: Jesu Khri tuh accingpaw khumnaw oun pyatu thua zah, ccangpaw zynnaw te cyisahnaw miakaw tuh Jesu kyate oun cciakhaeseitu hae nynh athua hae. Khri liate Pachia nynh laephi rae zah Khri liate amaw kalan khe bua oun kikhae cih. Khri te kyngkunaw kyalya te rou nynh laephi hynh khumnaw a ccou cih cite ngaehoinaw a um. Te Paul nynh hynh-e ccangpyanaw hynh zyntu hae hiinnaw pawcitemou asuilan a hoi cipaw kha a langsaku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul nynh Filemon kalan ccaw a zeipyapaw Onesimas hynh see thua zah, Kolose khua kalan Tikhikas nynh ccaw a phu lyaze a zuipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri a thuanaw te a ryalawnaw — 1.9—2.19</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri kya hiinnaw thawpaw — 2.20—4.6</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 4.7-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia rynaw liate Khri Jesu locceihtu athuapaw kae, Paul te kae unopaw Timote nynh,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kolosa khua um hae paw mithyaa hae te Khri kya a lungzipaw uno hae kalan ccaw kae ky oh. Ah Paaw Pachia kyate thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae kya la um vae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Lungtua Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nae hanlan saw kae sang vae ze, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri a Paaw athuapaw Pachia kalan lungtuabya zungzae kae ho, <verse number="4" style="v" />pawccecize Khri Jesu kha na zyn oh cipaw te mithyaa hae balyn kha na sungsah oh cipaw kha kae thae zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />vaawlang khua kya nae hanlan nungpya athuapaw ngaehoinaw keiccu nynh thua. E ngaehoinaw kong hynh nae kalan yn thuapaw byaccing bya athuapaw thehoypaw kya langmawlya phe na thae vae oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e thehoypaw tuh laephi pynpi kya athae thae zah alethung hawte, nanning nynh mah tuh-e tuh na thae nin oh kyate nae kya athae thae zah Pachia thawccinaw kha hmerarih lan na thaethya oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />E kong hynh kae sungsahpaw te rya kae lahkheihpaw Epafras kyate phe na ccangku vae oh. Aning tuh nanning hanlan Khri kya-e a lungzipaw ryalahtu nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Kol 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Flm 23</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Muisaw liate na sungsakunaw oh paw kong kha aning nynh kaening oun hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze kaening mah tuh-e kae thae nin te nae hanlan saw palei kae sangpah oh, te muisaw lante hawnaw te thaethyanaw balyn kyakhe Pachia rynaw nynaw khate phe na bia nawlan oh kae ngiapya oh, <verse number="10" style="v" />tuhteze nynh ahoypaw ryalaw miakaw kya athae na thae cih oh zah Pachia nynaw kya lethungte pawpaw balyn kya amaw lungrythua lante Bawipaw te angaekuhpaw hiinnaw te na hiin cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawpaw kya balyn lungtua biate lungsaete na ngaesang kho nawlan oh, Pachia phu-enaw huhan kyate yn thuapaw thawzung balyn khate nae thaw ae saesah oh sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Awnaw kya um hae paw mithyaa hae rho kha ae neesakuh bua oh paw Paaw kalan lungtuabya ho oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning nynh aening kha mohnaw huhan kyate oun luesah zah a sungsahpaw a Ccapaw kya-e peenaw lungkhu lang oun teesah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccapaw liate seingaethyanaw athuapaw shawkhawnaw kha ah mue oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Khri Hanghuaccenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccapaw tuh muih kho leipaw Pachia muinsan nynh thua, raepaw balyn kyaze ccatawccaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize vaaw te lae kya a umpaw, muih khopaw te muih kho leipaw, bawitungkhung hae, uknaw kaw hae, uktu hae, kawhoinaw hae, pawpaw balyn tuh Ccapaw liate rae athua—pawpaw balyn tuh amaw liate rae thua zah amaw hanlan nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccapaw tuh pawpaw balyn a um mawze um zah pawpaw balyn tuh amaw kya kyngkute a um hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khri tuh khriccaawbuu athuapaw pyn kya-e lu nynh thua; aning tuh pawpaw balyn kya ahang huaccepaw athua nawlan, athotakawnaw thua zah a chih hae paw kyaze ccatawccaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe 1.22-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia a ccingnaw balyn tuh Ccapaw kya a um, <verse number="20" style="v" />a vaelantung kya-e a chiise liate rhaw kha daesah zah, laephi kya umpaw uccaw hae thuasah, vaawlang umpaw uccaw hae thuasah pawpaw balyn kha Ccapaw liate amaw te bua ccawkuthui lan Pachia nynh a ry.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe 2.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning tuh langmawlya ahoy leipaw rya na law oh keiccuze Pachia te na sawkuh oh zah nae tuanaw kya rhaw hae nynh na la thua oh, <verse number="22" style="v" />tuhzemah atu tuh nanning kha athyaapaw, ccaenaw um leipaw te seinaw hoi leipaw lante Pachia malang thuakhae khylan amaw a pyn kya chinaw liate phe ae ccawsakuthui vae oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Na thae oh paw thehoypaw kya-e ngaehoinaw kyate nueku leite, zynnaw kya tynkaring lan na bingkuh cih oh zah po na tyn cih oh, tuh-e thehoypaw tuh vaawlui zakaw umpaw raepaw miakaw kya phy thua zah, kae, Paul tuh tuh-e thehoypaw hanlan ryalahtu nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri hanlan Paul Ryalawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nae hanlan vawsaw ka teingnaw kya atu ka lungtua, khriccaawbuu athuapaw amaw pyn hanlan Khri a teingnaw kya ahobou ungpaw kha ka pynsaw kya ka ccingsah. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pachia bya kha phe ccing lan ho khylan nanning hanlan kamaw yn pyapaw Pachia kya-e synriatu thuanaw thyhte kae tuh khriccaawbuu kya ryalahtu lang ka tang. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh-e byakhupaw tuh she hae kya te ciihan hae kya thuruh a la thua, thuasalama atu tuh a mithyaa hae kya langsahpya athua vae. <verse number="27" style="v" />E byakhupaw a phu-enaw kya-e hoirumnaw tuh hohcihmou ale cipaw Zenta hae kha nysah khylan Pachia nynh tuh-e mithyaa hae tuh a po hae; tuh-e byakhupaw tuh phu-enaw kya-e ngaehoinaw athuapaw, nae kya a umpaw Khri kha nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Kaening nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha Khri kya accingpaw lante kae thuakhae nawlan, ccungccaw miakaw kha raeringnaw pyate, hawnaw balyn khate ccangpyate Khri kong kha kae ho. <verse number="29" style="v" />E ryalaw hanlan ka lungkhu kya myarya athawsae lante Khri nynh yn pyapaw thungnaw balyn khate zuakute rya ka lah.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning hanlan thuasah, Laodisia khua kya um hae paw hanlan thuasah, ka mae yn muih boi leipaw balyn hanlan thuasah pawcih zuakute mou rya ka law cipaw kha nysah kae ry oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin nynh Pachia kya-e byakhupaw athuapaw Khri amaw ccaccei kha ccaerarih lan thaethya hae zah hoyte a ny nawlan hae, sungsakunaw kya sueluakuh hae zah mih thinlung tuh thawzung pya athua nawlan ka ry, <verse number="3" style="v" />hawnaw sisua hae te nynaw sisua hae balyn tuh Khri kya thuruh athua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hum ccungccaw nynh san soihpaw bya hae te nanning kha ae ling khyh nawlan oh e hynh kae hopya oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh pynsaw lante nae kya ka umbua khyh zemah muisaw lante nae kya ka um. Nanning nynh angaekuh lante na cyi oh paw te Khri kya nae zynnaw a tynpaw kha ka muih zah ka lungtua.</para>
  <para style="s">Khri kya Accingpaw Hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning nynh Khri Jesu Bawipaw kha phe na lawku vae oh hawte, amaw kya hiin ccavae oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaw kya tharui saw oh lah tynsakuh thung oh, ccangpya na thua vae oh hawte, zynnaw kya tyn oh lah lungtuabya patae ho oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khri ccangpyanaw thyhte thua leite, ccungccaw phung thyhte zui zah vaawlui te laephi uktu muisaw hae thyhte a zuipaw laephi thyahawnaw te accakaepaw lingkunaw khate hum nynh sanmah ae ro khyh nawlan oh la raeringkuh oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia thuanaw accingpaw balyn tuh Khri kya pynsaw lante a um. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kawhoinaw te uktu balyn kyaze lu athuapaw amaw liate nanning tuh na ccing oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khri kya-e vingdungawkunaw liate chiisaw te asekuhpaw pyn kha khahkute, kuih te rae leipaw vingdungawkunaw khate nanning mah amaw kya vingdungaw na thua oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptisma innaw kya Khri ryte uubua na thua oh. Khri kha chinaw kyate a thoosahpaw Pachia thungnaw kha zynnaw liate amaw ryte na thoothui bua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Seinaw te nae pynsaw vingdungawku leinaw kya na chih oh paw nanning kha Pachia nynh Khri ryte pynkheihlan ae hiinsah oh, ah seinaw balyn kha oun ngaethya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe 2.1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Aening oun rawsepaw laebah ccazing te a lungkhu umpaw phunglang hae kha vaelantung kya khiadete marya a the vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Efe 2.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Uktu hae te kawhoitu hae kha vua hae zah tuh-e hae tuh zapi malang langsahte vaelantung liate a tae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aenaw te nianaw, athyaapaw nin hae sungnaw, sawpaw adiapaw hae sungnaw, sabbath nin hae sungnaw te asekuh lante hum nynh san bya ae la pia nan oh sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rom 14.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuh yn thua cih paw uccaw hae kya-e mynlyh nynh thua hae; thuasalama accaccingpaw tuh Khri nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahme leipaw zakawsangsakunaw kya te vaaw hae beikpaw kya a lungrythuapaw hum nynh san thethya ae la ho nan oh sah; tuh-e paw tuh amaw a tuanaw khate accakaepaw kya a tansakuhpaw, a muihpaw vizin hae kha phang kyngkuh zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />lu athuapaw Khri kha varyng a kyngkuh leipaw nynh thua. Lu kyate pyn balyn tuh kua thua zah rukhua atungkunaw hae kyate pynkheihlan a khelekuh hae, Pachia kya-e lethungnaw te a lethung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe 4.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning tuh Khri ryte vaawlui te laephi uktu atakaw e muisaw hae kyate na chi vae oh athua lanze, pawccemou laephi te asekuh hae paw hawte na hiin oh? <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccemou, “Hae nan, taangtua nan, ty nan,” a ci hae paw phung hae kha na zui oh? <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e phung hae balyn tuh ccungccaw kawbya hae te ccangpyanaw hae kyalya thua zah, mang lalia te a zo cih hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />E hae tuh mawtemaw raekupaw beiknaw, ahme leipaw zakawsangsakunaw te pyn kha pawlangria leinaw kya hawnaw langkunaw a hoi ccaccing; thuasalama pynsaw duaanaw sungkunaw kya ccungkianaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khri kya Hiinnaw Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning tuh Khri ryte phe na thoothui bua vae oh athua ze, Pachia ranglang Khri haungnaw kya umpaw vaawlang e uccaw hae kha ccung oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Nae tuanaw kha vaawlang e uccaw hae kya nung oh, laephi uccaw hae kya nung nan oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh na chih oh zah nae hiinnaw tuh Khri ryte Pachia kya thuruh athua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aening hiinnaw athuapaw Khri he yn langkuh te, nanning mah phu-enaw kya amaw ryte nae langkuh bua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ohhuakunaw, nungsikunaw, sungku kho leipaw rynaw, ahoy leipaw duaanaw, zohtuh beiknaw athuapaw karankunaw cikuh hae paw, nae lungkhu umpaw laephi te asekuhpaw miakaw kha chisah oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcihawpaw uccaw hae keiccu nynh Pachia thinrianaw tuh kawngae lei hae paw tungvaw kya a thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e hiinnaw kya na la hiin lya oh tuh nanning mah langmawlya tuh-e laanpi hae tuh na la zui oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama atu hynh-e hae balyn—thinrianaw, bungpawnaw, thinlung hoy leipaw, thethya honaw, nae khalang kyate anungsikuhpaw bya hopaw kha la vua oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Lu kheit te lu kheit hynpakuh nan oh, pawccecize ccungccaw rynpaw te a cyisahnaw kha phe na vua vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaw a raetupaw muinsan thyhte, nynaw kya thawsah thui athuapaw ccungccaw thawpaw khate phe na ccaankuh vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Gen 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe 4.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e thawsahthuinaw kya Grik ci um khyh, Judah ci um khyh, vingdungawkuhpaw ci um khyh, vingdungawkuh leipaw ci um khyh, angaeepaw ci um khyh, Sithian ccungccaw ci um khyh, see ci um khyh, a luepaw ci um khyh; Khri tuh pawpaw tynre thua zah pawpaw tynre kya balyn a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning tuh Pachia nynh a popaw, athyaapaw te sungsahpaw na thua oh hawte, ngaethyaumsahnaw, thawccikunaw, zakawsangsakunaw, lungnenaw, lungsaenaw khate ccaankuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh mingccangpaw tungvaw lungccing leinaw a hoi ze, lu kheit te lu kheit ngaesangpyakute ngaethyakuh oh; Bawipaw nynh ae ngaethya vae oh hawte, lu kheit te lu kheit ngaethyakuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe 4.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Hynh-e hae balyn laelan, accingpaw lunglokunaw liate pawpaw balyn a sueluapaw sungsakunaw khate ccaankuh oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Khri kya-e daenaw nynh nae thinlung kha ae la uk oh sah; tuh-e daenaw elang nynh nanning kha pyn pynkheit kya um lan ko na thua oh; te lungtuabya hothya oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Khri bya tuh nae kya phe beih lan la um sah; lu kheit te lu kheit hawnaw tynre te ccangpyakute raeringnaw pyakuh oh; nae thinlung kyakhe lungtuanaw thinlung te sam hlaw hae, thehoynaw hlaw hae te muisaw hlaw hae kha Pachia kalan sah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efe 5.19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Na cyi oh paw miakaw kha bya na ho oh zemah, ryalaw na law oh zemah Bawipaw Jesu min liate pawpaw balyn kha cyih oh lah, amaw liate Paaw Pachia kalan lungtuabya ho oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Innbyn hanlan Phung hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zu hae, Bawipaw kya angaekuhpaw athua hawte nae vawpaw hae kaw kha ngae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5.22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Pe 3.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Vawpaw hae, nae zu hae kha sungsah oh lah, minmin kya reisakuh nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5.25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Pe 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccaaw hae, pawpaw kya balyn nae nung nae paaw hae kaw la ngae oh, pawccecize tuh-e tuh Bawipaw lungrypaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Paaw hae, nae ccaaw hae kha thinriasah nan oh, mih lung oun rohsei cih. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />See hae, pawpaw kya balyn laephi vaw e nae bawi hae kaw kha la ngae oh, mih lungrythuasah khylan te mit te muihbianaw kyalya thua leite Pachia rawrite, thinlung balynte mih kaw la ngae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22-25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6.5-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae rya a lahpaw hawte thua leite, Bawipaw rya a lahpaw hawte pawpaw na cyi oh zemah thinlung ccaccingte cyih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nae ryalaw mee rho uccaw kha Bawipaw kyate na mue cih oh cipaw kha nyh oh; pawccecize Khri Bawipaw rya nynh na law oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahoy leipaw rya a lahpaw tuh a lawpaw hoyleinaw hanlan pyaru athua cih; maedo ci um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deu 10.17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawi hae, nae see hae kha dingnaw te hoyte ccuepe oh, pawccecize nanning mah vaawlang khua kya Bawi kae hoi cipaw na ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuhlaepaw Ccangpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saw tyty sang oh, lungtuabya hote kyhrarih lante sawsang oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Khri kya-e byakhupaw kha kae ho kho nawlan, Pachia nynh a byaho khonaw thuakaw kha kaening oun hungpya nawlan saw oun la sangpah oh; tuh-e byakhupaw keiccuze kae tuh thong ka ccah, <verse number="4" style="v" />tuh-e byakhupaw tuh ho lan ka ccan thyhte ccaerarih lan ka ho kho nawlan saw yn la sangpah oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atolang e ccungccaw hae kya hawnaw te la um oh lah, accyh miakaw kha hoyte la mang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe 5.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw kha pawtemou byakhung lan cipaw na nythya nawlan oh, nae byaho tuh loi te ekhaekuh sah lah, ngae ry um zungzae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Nyathya Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Taikhikas nynh ka konglang balyn kha ae la hopah cih oh; aning tuh Bawipaw kya a lungzipaw ryalahtu, rya kae lahkheihpaw te sungsahpaw ka neitaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Loc 20.4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Ti 4.12</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe 6.21-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae konglang na ny nawlan oh te aning nynh nae thinlung kha thawpya khylan amaw kha nae kalan kae saw. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning tuh Onesimas ryte oun cceih hae, Onesimas tuh nanning laku e lu kheit thua zah a lungzipaw te kae sungsahpaw kae neitaw nynh thua. Minmin nynh hein kya acyihkuhpaw balyn kha ae hopah cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Flm 10-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae te thong kae ccahkheihpaw Aristarkhas te Barnabas a neitaw lanpaw Mark nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. Mark tuh nae kalan yn thua ze leh la khan oh cite amaw konglang kha bya kae tawsya vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Loc 19.29</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27.2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Loc 12.12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Justas a ci hae paw Jesu nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. Vingdungawkuh hae paw kyaze minmin kyalya nynh Pachia peenaw hanlan rya kae lahkheihpaw te lungtangnaw yn pya hae paw athua hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning lakuze lu kheit athuapaw, Khri seepaw Epafras nynh ae beihlang oh. Nanning nynh accingpaw lante na thadyn oh zah Pachia rynaw balyn kha phe ccing lan na zui nawlan oh aning nynh zungzae zuakute saw ae sangpah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Flm 23</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning hanlan te Laodisia khua te Hierapolis khua kya um hae paw hanlan aning tuh thawte rya a lah cipaw kae nynh ccaekia ka khan. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kae sungsahpaw sibawi Luka te Demas nynh ae beihlang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Ti 4.10</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm 24</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Laodisia khua e uno hae te Nimfa te a inn kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kalan ka beihlangnaw hae kha yn la hopah oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />E ccaky hynh naemaw kya he na ria kou oh te, Laodisia khriccaawbuu kya mah la riasah oh; tuhawte Laodisia kyate na mue oh paw ccaky kha mah la riabua oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Arkhippas kha, “Bawipaw kya na muepaw ryalaw kha na lyn nawlan pe la ki,” cite la hopah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Flm 2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kae, Paul nynh hynh-e beihlangnaw hynh kamaw kuih te nynh ka zei. Khiikunaw ka teingpaw hynh la liathui oh. Thawccinaw tuh nae kya la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>